"Stays awake on battery too; the display turns off when the lid closes. Turn it off before putting it in a bag." = "Stays awake on battery too; the display turns off when the lid closes. Turn it off before putting it in a bag.";
"The calendar rule needs Calendar access (System Settings ▸ Privacy)" = "The calendar rule needs Calendar access (System Settings ▸ Privacy)";
